OL,5,G0300 Great American Railroad Journeys
OL,6,     FMontreal to Ottawa: In Montreal,
OL,7,     FMichael Portillo learns how French
OL,8,     Fand British colonial roots have
OL,9,     Finfluenced the city. In Ottawa,
OL,10,     Fthe former politician visits the
OL,11,     Fcountry's parliament.
OL,12,G0350 Great American Railroad Journeys
OL,13,     FThousand Islands to Toronto:
OL,14,     FMichael Portillo takes to the
OL,15,     Fwater for a nautical journey
OL,16,     Fthrough the Thousand Islands,
OL,17,     Fbefore his railway journey across
OL,18,     FCanada concludes in Toronto.
